<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudanese army secured Bakori and Sali, repelled attacks in the Blue Nile and advanced in West Kordofan. Pakistan signed a 1.5 billion military deal to bolster Sudan’s security. The UN found Colombian mercenaries backed by the UAE fighting in Sudan. A former interior minister from the al-Bashir regime was arrested and Ahmed Haroun appeared on a podcast, prompting legal commentary. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQV1dFT1YwMFRzN0hoMHVfQ2tTakU1bnc2ZEFSdGV4WWIyN283dEZoLXVVTVNCMm1CaXg1bFZkSngtYy1IS2xBRkJjT0ZtN2hHLWI0Tm5CTmp6YkhGd1ZqOGhpZnh5S2tvNlR4TWpBMlpxamM4QWw3bXV5cnljb2ItUUJlMk4?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNVUFxT1Z3UmptQkoyWVhDRnh2cVBkRnEwRTZha0tjS21hZE91RDlub1V2ODEzekc3VTFqS3oxZVRRS0xnVjBnQ0sxV05SU1N6cDdlX1ktQ08waHhTTmNiNTRqY3d1aW1ZdFdvZkFNbUNYakVTXzNPZkZzekJISkxEQjZ2NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;GK Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxORWhVNDU1UkxJQldKYWtRNk1uRTIyMmhHS2ZBcHpUZU05bkJiclhFT2NJSks0bEN2M2lLcTAyeGw0ZmNFM2tkYzFPZEpybWlpdzlXaWxCcWVVdFNEWTdFNkliN25EZ2cxam1rb1ExRy1BWXVhWjR6dlcwZnpXeEl5eWhBR1ZGX08zVGZNMU9USktmWWliMW5yWC13TWlYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;RadarOnline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1kZXJGam41ODFITDY2aDg0MkVXUnIxcGRQSGcxVVJIS243Q3pjNnVRZGE2S2dfNk9VanFkV2pINU8xZWNsYW54NEhlcmhXblIw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTWF2djZrT293NGk4VU83VkFQRzhrcEc2MHJJTDYwb0YzcHAxVTJLVTZyTDBuS05tX0xwWG1ZaWRHTUdGdzRYSnRwcWx3SE5QbDdTVllSQUw3MjgyOC1KclZaNFBCeFRLUUpJYzdEWXhHaE9ucHlzc20tMnlQejJldGJFUEl6cUNmdmNUM3FGUW8tc2s5VE